{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19113","headline":"途次华州陪钱大夫登城北楼春望因覩李崔令狐三相国唱和之什翰林旧侣继踵华城山水清高鸾凤翔集皆忝宿眷遂题此诗 · 刘禹锡","name":"途次华州陪钱大夫登城北楼春望因覩李崔令狐三相国唱和之什翰林旧侣继踵华城山水清高鸾凤翔集皆忝宿眷遂题此诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城楼四望出风尘，见尽关西渭北春。\n百二山河雄上国，一双旌斾委名臣。\n壁中今日题诗处，天上同时草诏人。\n莫怪老郎呈滥吹，宦途虽别旧情亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}